    "title": "Coachella 2026: All the bands and art we saw during Day 2, Weekend 1 of music festival",
    "text": "Day 2 of Weekend 1 of the Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival is going strong Saturday, April 11, and we’ve got the photos to prove it. Headliner Justin Bieber is set to take the stage at 11:25 p.m. Other highlights for the day include The Strokes, Sombr and Nine Inch Noize. Things To Do: Let us help you plan your adventures with stories on events, entertainment and culture near you.By signing up, you agree to our Terms of Use, Privacy Policy, and to receive emails from The Press-Enterprise.Follow along with us throughout the day as we continue to update our gallery with all the musical performances we catch and the art and fashion we see along the way. Labrinth performs at the Outdoor Theatre during Coachella Music and Arts Festival in Indio on Saturday, April 11, 2026. (Photo by Watchara Phomicinda, Contributing Photographer) 1 of 74Labrinth performs at the Outdoor Theatre during Coachella Music and Arts Festival in Indio on Saturday, April 11, 2026. (Photo by Watchara Phomicinda, Contributing Photographer) Expand Jury finds that Ticketmaster and Live Nation had an anticompetitive monopoly over big concert venues Coachella 2026: Weekend 2 set times include special guest Kacey Musgraves Phil Collins, Iron Maiden, Sade, Oasis, Wu-Tang Clan and Luther Vandross get into Rock Hall Veganchella 2026: The best plant-based dishes at Coachella from SoCal vendors 2026 April 11",
